'''Vicki''' is a [[Human|human]] [[Non-Playable-Character|NPC]] that can be found in [[Bristlewood]], located in [[Briarwood]]. She is found in multiple [[Locations|areas]] depending on what part of the [[Archer]] [[Jobs|Job]] quest series you are on.

Vicki is initially found at Farnum's Farm. Later in the series, she can be found directly north of the Bristlewood [[Warpstones|Warpstone]], hiding in front of a large thorny tree root (she would be easily visible from the warpstone, but a huge mushroom is in the way). Her accomplice stands to her left.
